{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2021-01-21 16:30:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ ANNOUNCES COMPLETION OF EXCHANGE OFFER', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ”) AND ITS 100% OWNED SUBSIDIARY KRAFT HEINZ FOODS COMPANY (THE “ISSUER”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE FINAL RESULTS OF THE ISSUER'S OFFER TO EXCHANGE CERTAIN OF THE ISSUER'S OUTSTANDING UNREGISTERED NOTES FOR NEW REGISTERED NOTES (THE “EXCHANGE OFFER”). UNDER THE EXCHANGE OFFER, THE ISSUER OFFERED TO EXCHANGE UP TO (I) $1,000,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF NEW 3.750% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2030, (II) $500,000,000"}